    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26750" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δί-ζυξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῠγος</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>double-yoked,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.195
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				10.473
			</span></i>; <i>double,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίζυγος ἠπείροιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					4.3b
				</span></i>
			.<i><span class="en">
				40
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. χαλκός</span>
			<i>castanets,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.139
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Claudian</span>): neut. pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίζυγα ξύλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(9).907.30
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Chalcis</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίζυγι πυρί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					22.352
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κῶλα</span>
			<i>having two bones</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διζυγής</span>), Paul. Aeg.<i><span class="en">
				6.107
			</span></i>.</div>
